# Conformance probe pack for ruling 9 of 0.56: a default is checked against
# `range` also where a held `also` key supplies the bits. Public. No kinds.
#   x 8 (also y), default x 99
format  conformance-range-056-10
version 0.56.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    bits
layout  sequential
bit_order msb
field   probe.x  8  uint  range 0 10
also    probe.y
default probe.x  99
